Modifications (patches/ and tools/prune-dir.sh in this repository). Each
modified upstream file starts with a "LOCAL PATCH (team build)" notice
(patches/patch-change-notices.diff), and the changed parts are marked
"LOCAL PATCH" or "TEAM BUILD":
- a draft-only scope profile as the default: no Mail.Send, no mailbox
  settings, no delete or rules tools, and a request-level guard on the
  signed-in user's own mailbox;
- Microsoft only: @usejunior/provider-gmail's dist/index.js is replaced by
  a stub (src/provider-gmail-stub.js) and its package.json loses the Google
  dependencies (tools/prune-dir.sh);
- read-only access to shared mailboxes;
- an explicit team client id is required and the tenant is pinned at build
  time; the send allowlist is always empty;
- a pinned, hash-checked installer and launcher, and a cross-platform token
  cache (keytar prebuilds, DPAPI on Windows);
- @azure/msal-node 7.2.2.

Other bundled third-party packages and their licenses are listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES inside the release package.
